  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"0.1.2\"\n\npackage:\n  name: pacman\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://gitlab.com/drti/pacman/-/archive/v${{ version }}/pacman-v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 8da7c647fcdae42cecf8846d9fc4f872c21aa0f989dbb869a850df8e1642d2e9\n  patches:\n    # Upstream has no dllexport annotations, so the Windows DLL exported nothing.\n    - 0001-export-public-api-on-windows.patch\n    # Kokkos::finalize() from a C atexit handler deadlocks on Windows once the\n    # Kokkos Threads backend is enabled (kokkos >=5.2.2 hf81792a_1).\n    - 0002-finalize-kokkos-from-python-atexit.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  dynamic_linking:\n    rpath_allowlist:\n      - $ORIGIN\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake >=3.31,<4\n    - ninja\n  host:\n    - arborx >=2.1\n    - kokkos >=5.2\n    - kokkos-kernels >=5.2\n    - numpy\n    - pybind11 >=3\n    - python\n  run:\n    - arborx >=2.1\n    - kokkos >=5\n    - kokkos-kernels >=5\n    - numpy\n    - python\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - pacman\n  - script:\n      - if: unix\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/lib/cmake/PACMAN/PACMANConfig.cmake\n        else: if exist %LIBRARY_PREFIX%\\lib\\cmake\\PACMAN\\PACMANConfig.cmake (exit 0) else (exit 1)\n  - script:\n      - if: linux\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/lib/libpacman_interface_cpp.so\n      - if: osx\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/lib/libpacman_interface_cpp.dylib\n      - if: win\n        then:\n          - if not exist %LIBRARY_BIN%\\pacman_interface_cpp.dll exit 1\n          - if not exist %LIBRARY_LIB%\\pacman_interface_cpp.lib exit 1\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://gitlab.com/drti/pacman\n  summary: Portable algorithms for coupling, mapping, and adaptive interpolation\n  description: PACMAN is a C++ library with Python and Fortran bindings for portable coupling, mapping, and adaptive interpolation of scientific data.\n  license: BSD-3-Clause\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  documentation: https://drti.gitlab.io/pacman/\n  repository: https://gitlab.com/drti/pacman\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - fbordeu\n    - messahelramzi\n",
